 "hypothesis": "The R127 model under the kaon identification systematic as the kaon paper states it: the amplitude rising from 4% at x_F 0.25 to 12% at 0.40 for K+ and from 0 to 6% at 0.50 for K-, one correlated scale per charge, in place of the flat 8% / 4% above 0.25; the fit reports the scales in units of the amplitude, the K+ rows above x_F 0.25 scaled and bare, and the parameters against R127 (the chi2 scale changes with the error model).",
