  "intact_t_break": "TopologyNominalParams.intact_t_break (2026-10-24): generate_sd draws the intact proton's transfer by draw_t_window_break (one uniform, the orientation of draw_t_window); log_density_ratio takes the ratio of the normalized two-slope densities for the intact-proton events of the single-diffraction classes, the break fixed",
