  "one_pion_exchange": "na49_mixing.one_pion_exchange and generate_sd's ope_component (nested b081f0e): the band [s_tail, s_tail + s_pi) of the component uniform, the neutron remnant of the pi+ exchange, the X++ line, (M^2, t) from the pion flux jointly on the reachable window; the engine's sd_ope and sd_ope_share (its events carry s_pi / s_pi0, the coherence events (1 - s - s_pi) / (1 - s0 - s_pi0))",
